aquila-radio-astronomy (0.2.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Licence: GPL-3.0-or-later (was MIT).
  * Packaged builds (Windows, macOS): the hit curator runs again, and "open the
    app at login" writes a command the packaged app accepts.
  * The observer keeps going when the desktop app that started it is closed or
    killed, instead of stopping with a traceback.
  * Snap: a dialog explains the one-time USB permission, with a button to the
    App Center permissions page.
  * Connect to node: an address typed with Caps Lock on still works.
  * About box names the source repository.

